  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Omi. 4p partnerships. 32 cards A-7. Trump chosen by R of dealer after 4 cards. 8 tricks. Tokens: 4-4=none; 5-7 declarer=1, defenders=2; 8 tricks=3. First to 10 wins.',
    Player: 'Omi: Four players, partners opposite. First 4 cards dealt, then you (right of dealer) name trumps. Four more cards each. Play eight tricks. Win 10 tokens to win the game.',
    objective: 'Take more tricks than the opponents. Teams score token cards; first team to collect 10 or more tokens wins.',
    gameplay: "1. After trump is announced, player to dealer's right leads any card. 2. Play proceeds counter-clockwise. Players must follow suit if able; otherwise may play any card. 3. Highest trump wins; if no trump played, highest card of suit led wins. 4. Trick winner gathers cards, leads next trick. 5. After 8 tricks, tokens are awarded according to the scoring table.",
    keyRules: [
      "Trump chosen by player to dealer's right after seeing only first 4 cards.",
      'Must follow suit if able.',
      '8 tricks total.',
      'Token scoring: 4-4 split = no tokens, but extra token next time a team takes more than 4.',
      '5-7 tricks for trump-choosing team = 1 token; for non-declarers = 2 tokens.',
      'All 8 tricks (Kapothi/Basthe) = 3 tokens.',
      'First team to 10 tokens wins.',
    ],
