      equipment: '32 playing cards; 20 token cards (2-6 of each suit). One player holds black tokens (clubs, spades 2-6); an opponent holds red tokens (hearts, diamonds 2-6).',
      dealing: "Dealer shuffles and offers cut to opponent on left. Dealer deals 4 cards to each player. Player to dealer's right announces trump (without consulting partner). Dealer then deals 4 more cards to each (8 total).",
